  "description": "Features\n\nOptimized from the ground up around 27.5″ wheels\n\nLower BB provides that “in, not on” the bike” feel\n\nPF120 BB to best utilize the clearance for both tires and chainrings\n\nNarrow Q factor, yet keeps 5” tire capability\n\nIn-frame storage under down tube to keep weight from rarely needed items such as a spare tube as low as possible\n\nMaximum standover height clearance, combined with a huge volume increase over the previous generation in the main triangle for frame bags – all of it low for the lowest possible center of gravity\n\nShorter axle-to-crown fork height to increase main triangle storage capacity, with multiple mount options.\n\nPortage handle to easily lift the bike when using a frame bag\n\nUDH for easy replacement of derailleur hanger, and SRAM Transmission capability\n\n180mm Post mount front & rear for maximum stopping power\n\nIntegrated rack & full frame bag mounting points for strapless bag attachment\n\nSleeved internal cable routing for ease of assembly and maintenance",
